AB  - Accessing judicial information in India remains a challenging and time-consuming task. Legal professionals, researchers, and citizens often struggle with fragmented data scattered across PDFs, government portals, Excel sheets, and legal documents. Additionally, the absence of real-time updates results in outdated case statuses and unreliable legal insights. To overcome these obstacles, we introduce an AI-powered RetrievalAugmented Generation (RAG) chatbot designed to transform legal accessibility by delivering real-time judicial insights. This system employs advanced web scraping techniques and direct API integrations with judicial databases to ensure timely and accurate legal information. By utilizing FAISS vector databases, the chatbot enables rapid and efficient searches across vast legal datasets. At the core of this innovation is Natural Language Processing (NLP) driven by large language models (LLMs), ensuring users receive precise answers, even for intricate legal inquiries. Designed with a user-friendly approach, the chatbot offers multilingual support, voice assistance, and seamless integration with essential services like live court streaming, eFiling, and Tele-Law. Its robust error-handling mechanisms enhance user interactions, making legal resources more accessible to lawyers, students, and the general public. Built on a scalable cloud infrastructure, the solution ensures reliable performance and smooth accessibility across web and mobile platforms. Future developments will incorporate predictive legal analytics and historical case insights, further strengthening its role as an intelligent legal assistant. By bridging the gap between citizens and the justice system, this AI-driven chatbot fosters greater transparency, accessibility, and efficiency in legal services, marking a significant step toward a more informed and empowered society.
ER  - 

